# Project artwork lives here.
#
# The filenames are NOT derived from the project id. Each project names its
# own file via `art:` in src/data/content.js, and tools/check_content.mjs
# asserts that the named file actually exists on disk.
#
# Current mapping:
#
#   product-search.jpeg    -> 01  AI-Powered Smart Product Search
#   career-copilot.jpeg    -> 02  AI Career Copilot
#   retail-analytics.jpeg  -> 03  Retail Sales Analytics Dashboard
#   skin-lesion-cnn.jpeg   -> 04  Skin Lesion Classification
#   upi-sentinel.jpeg      -> 05  UPI Sentinel AI
#
# To swap a project's artwork, either replace the file in place or change the
# `art:` value in content.js. A PNG named <project-id>.png in this directory
# is also picked up as a fallback.
#
# The site renders a generated schematic for any project whose artwork cannot
# be loaded, and logs a console warning naming the paths it tried.
